    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> FAQs </h1>",
      "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Frequently asked questions about applying for a job at ZOLLER</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c4063",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "What documents are required for a complete job application?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Please send us your resume digitally by using the relevant application form for the posted position.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4060",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How do I know that my job application has been received successfully?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Once you apply, you will receive a confirmation e-mail to the e-mail address you provided.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4056",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How long will my application documents be stored?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Up to three years.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4054",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How does the application process work at ZOLLER?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>You will receive an automatic notification of receipt by e-mail once your application has been entered into our system. We will notify you if we wish to interview.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4052",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Can I send an unsolicited application to ZOLLER?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>No, you must apply for open positions on the website.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4068",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Can I apply to write my thesis at ZOLLER?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>We would be delighted if you would like to write a practice-oriented bachelor's or master's thesis at our company. Simply send us your topic suggestions for specific areas of the company <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"mailto:bewerbung@zoller.info\" title=\"To the Human Resources department\">by email</a>. Ideally, you should combine your thesis with an internship at ZOLLER.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4072",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Does ZOLLER also offer a dual study program?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Yes, ZOLLER offers the following courses for a dual study program at the DHBW in Stuttgart:</p><ul><li>Data Science and Artificial Intelligence</li><li>Computer Science</li><li>Computer Science – Information Technology</li><li>Mechanical Engineering – Design and Development</li><li>Industrial Engineering – General Industrial Engineering</li></ul><p>The dual study program begins in the winter semester of each year. For more information, please visit the ZOLLER website in the Dual Study section or the <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://www.dhbw-stuttgart.de/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">DHBW</a> website <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://www.dhbw-stuttgart.de/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">in Stuttgart</a>.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4074",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c4062",
      "bg": "",
